<description>&lt;p&gt;ELN guerrillas used armed drones to kill a Colombian soldier and the Colombian Air Force bombed a guerrilla camp, killing at least three combatants, while FARC also operates armed drones. A stadium collapse in Colombia killed at least four people and a major earthquake has caused more than 224 deaths, with rescue operations ongoing. Russian forces struck a deployment hub in Ukraine used by Colombian mercenaries. The United Nations urged De la Espriella to uphold the peace agreement, and a U.S. indictment has revived former FARC leader Timochenko's name in a Venezuelan case. The UCDP recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxNYkUtWWVOWGUzMWlLaTU5SDV4Q1phdGhINVlOS2pyVWFoN1ZDOHZ6cE5nYkZVWkJnSjhHTzJnUWN6MFJ3TDZFQm9kZFJrdW9UczI4akRjUmpQYkdwZXd0ZEM0ZDFYZmhJVUFEMlRkYm0wOW1fOFY0MlZ5ejBUbEFVRlJ3eU5HUmJVby1feW9WYXlTc05QVTNVVUpXdklPVDJiV0I1TDFyUEY?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;GOV.UK&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxQR1hQVWt5WWh5S0cwa1hCNU0tVUx4VzZGZmpXS185Q3Q2VXB4LTJNRXF2cGhQOE44dDRfVmhLNlVTWnZfR19udlg5X0d2SDdMS2U2OXg4M0R3SEJicVVhMkxGSGN2LVZ3TGlEa2RlUDVhM2l4OWVPV0tobUduR2FUeVhFQWhCRTZrNGxyQmZVNWVONUdEU1lkN0NwQW1SbmhBdU1rWENxeVo0STBGUGdaQW1UTGdlYlE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nine.com.au&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxNTldyT0ZxZ2NMUThObG53NUN0RmVya3VCLTRfcGhvSXBzNTZDNE1VUHlraEhGdEdnY0NIOUFHUGpaSzZPYkpEVktFSlVHZmFxRVNvQ1l1ZW9tVWdwdkhrS2dZalk2czJ4ZjZHTmltNUptWGZNVFZjT2VxQ2htem9mdFJQNlZCTWNXS1lqMk04blNGMjNUdF9OWWZucmx6WkN2T3k0RGNkVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Small Wars Journal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;